        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft mb-4">Tai Chi, yoga, meditación, filosofía de ruta.</p>
        <span class="text-[#E8530E] font-semibold text-sm group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-block">Próximamente →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="#" class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-[#E8530E]/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-8px_rgba(232,83,14,0.2)] transition-all duration-300 group">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-10 h-10 text-slate-400 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] transition-colors duration-300 mb-4"><path d="M3.5 21 14 3"/><path d="M20.5 21 10 3"/><path d="M15.5 21 12 15l-3.5 6"/><path d="M2 21h20"/></svg>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-2 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] transition-colors">Viaje</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft mb-4">Camping, logística, fronteras, finanzas en ruta.</p>
        <span class="text-[#E8530E] font-semibold text-sm group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-block">Próximamente →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="#" class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-[#E8530E]/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-8px_rgba(232,83,14,0.2)] transition-all duration-300 group">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-10 h-10 text-slate-400 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] transition-colors duration-300 mb-4"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-2 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] transition-colors">Relatos de Viajeros</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft mb-4">Rutas, culturas y paisajes globales sobre dos ruedas.</p>
        <span class="text-[#E8530E] font-semibold text-sm group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-block">Próximamente →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="#" class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-[#E8530E]/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-8px_rgba(232,83,14,0.2)] transition-all duration-300 group">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-10 h-10 text-slate-400 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] transition-colors duration-300 mb-4"><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z"/><path d="m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z"/><path d="M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0"/><path d="M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62 0-5 0-5"/></svg>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-2 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] transition-colors">Cicloviaje | Cicloturismo</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft mb-4">Rutas, culturas y paisajes globales sobre dos ruedas.</p>
        <span class="text-[#E8530E] font-semibold text-sm group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-block">Próximamente →</span>
      </a>
    
      <a href="#" class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-[#E8530E]/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-8px_rgba(232,83,14,0.2)] transition-all duration-300 group">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-10 h-10 text-slate-400 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] transition-colors duration-300 mb-4"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="M12 5v14"/></svg>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-2 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] transition-colors">Primeros auxilios y Supervivencia</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft mb-4">Botiquín, emergencias y protocolos de seguridad en zonas remotas.</p>
        <span class="text-[#E8530E] font-semibold text-sm group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-block">Próximamente →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="#" class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-[#E8530E]/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-8px_rgba(232,83,14,0.2)] transition-all duration-300 group">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-10 h-10 text-slate-400 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] transition-colors duration-300 mb-4"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polygon points="16.24 7.76 14.12 14.12 7.76 16.24 9.88 9.88 16.24 7.76"/></svg>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-2 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] transition-colors">Mecánica de bicicletas</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft mb-4">Mantenimiento, reparaciones y ajuste de tu bici en ruta.</p>
        <span class="text-[#E8530E] font-semibold text-sm group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-block">Próximamente →</span>
      </a>
      <a href="#" class="bg-surface border border-line rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-[#E8530E]/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_40px_-8px_rgba(232,83,14,0.2)] transition-all duration-300 group">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-10 h-10 text-slate-400 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] transition-colors duration-300 mb-4"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-ink mb-2 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] transition-colors">Otra 2</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-ink-soft mb-4">Más herramientas y guías para potenciar tu experiencia.</p>
        <span class="text-[#E8530E] font-semibold text-sm group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform inline-block">Próximamente →</span>
      </a>
</div>

    <!-- PORTAL: NOTICIAS E INFORMACIÓN (Notificaciones + RSS) -->
    <div id="notificaciones" class="mt-20 scroll-mt-24">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-3"><span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Activa </span><span class="text-ink">las notificaciones</span></h2>
        <p class="text-ink-soft text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">Para recibir nuestras publicaciones diarias activa las:</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl border-2 border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-transparent hover:border-[#E8530E]/40 transition-all group flex flex-col justify-between h-full">
          <div>
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-12 h-12 mb-4 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] dark:group-hover:text-orange-500 transition-colors"><path d="M6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 7 3 9 3 9H3s3-2 3-9"/><path d="M10.3 21a1.94 1.94 0 0 0 3.4 0"/></svg>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-2">Notificaciones Soberanas</h3>
            <p class="text-ink-soft mb-6"><span class="font-bold text-ink">Privacidad y Transparencia:</span> Al hacer clic, tu navegador genera una clave anónima y segura. Solo recibirás avisos de nuevas publicaciones y podés desactivarlo en cualquier momento desde la configuración de tu dispositivo.</p>
            <div class="flex justify-center"><WebPushSubscribe /></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
        <div class="p-8 rounded-3xl border-2 border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-transparent hover:border-[#E8530E]/40 group transition-all">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-12 h-12 mb-4 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] dark:group-hover:text-orange-500 transition-colors"><path d="M4 11a9 9 0 0 1 9 9"/><path d="M4 4a16 16 0 0 1 16 16"/><circle cx="5" cy="19" r="1"/></svg>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink mb-3">RSS Feed (Open Source)</h3>
          <p class="text-ink-soft mb-6">La forma más pura y descentralizada de seguir nuestras novedades.</p>
          <a href={'/' + lang + '/rss/'} class="inline-block px-8 py-3 rounded-lg border border-[#E8530E] text-[#E8530E] font-semibold hover:bg-[#E8530E]/10 transition-all">Ver instrucciones</a>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl border-2 border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 bg-transparent hover:border-[#E8530E]/40 transition-all group flex flex-col items-start text-center ">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-12 h-12 mb-4 text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 group-hover:text-[#E8530E] dark:group-hover:text-orange-500 transition-colors"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M18 17V9"/><path d="M13 17V5"/><path d="M8 17v-3"/></svg>
          <div class="space-y-3 text-ink-soft max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          <p class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">
            <span id="push-counter" class="text-[#E8530E] font-bold">0</span> <span class="text-sm font-semibold">TOTAL ACTIVACIONES NOTIFICACIONES</span>
          </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
  <script>
    (async () => {
      const el = document.getElementById('push-counter');
      if (!el) return;
      const urls = [
        'https://sportdharmaecosystem.com/stats.json?nocache=' + Date.now(),
        'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Favio31/sportdharma-ecosystem-landing/main/public/stats.json'
      ];
      for (const url of urls) {
        try {
          const res = await fetch(url, { cache: 'no-store' });
          if (!res.ok) continue;
          const data = await res.json();
          if (typeof data.push_subscribers === 'number') {
            el.textContent = data.push_subscribers;
            console.log('[counter] OK desde', url, '=>', data.push_subscribers);
            return;
          }
        } catch (e) {
          console.warn('[counter] fallo', url, e.message);
        }
      }
      console.error('[counter] NO se pudo obtener stats.json');
    })();
  </script>
</section>

